answerCalls.rawCandidateText:
{
  "directAnswer": "Foreign branch profits remitted into Singapore by a Singapore tax-resident company are generally subject to Singapore corporate income tax under Section 10(1) of the Income Tax Act 1947, unless they qualify for tax exemption under Section 13(8) or Section 13(12) of the Income Tax Act 1947 (such as foreign-sourced dividend, branch profit, or service income meeting specific conditions), or are covered by a Avoidance of Double Taxation Agreement (DTA).",
  "keyRules": [
    "Section 10(1) of the Income Tax Act 1947 captures income received in Singapore from outside Singapore.",
    "Section 13(8) of the Income Tax Act 1947 exempts foreign-sourced dividends, branch profits, and service income remitted into Singapore if: (a) the income is subject to tax of a similar character to income tax under the law of the jurisdiction from which the income is received; (b) at the time the income is received in Singapore, the highest rate of tax of a similar character to income tax charged by the foreign jurisdiction on the income is at least 15%; and (c) the Comptroller of Income Tax is satisfied that the tax exemption would be beneficial to the resident person.",
    "Section 13(12) of the Income Tax Act 1947 allows the Minister or Comptroller to grant tax exemption on specified foreign income even if the headline tax rate condition in Section 13(8)(b) is not met, subject to meeting qualifying conditions."
  ],
  "caveats": [
    "Even if exempt under Section 13(8), foreign branch profits may still be subject to tax if they do not meet the headline tax rate or tax-subject-to-tax conditions, unless an administrative concession or Section 13(12) exemption applies.",
    "Singapore has completely liberalised all foreign exchange controls, meaning there are no statutory restrictions on cross-border remittances or profit repatriation under the Monetary Authority of Singapore Act 1970 & Foreign Exchange Framework."
  ],
  "statuteReferences": [
    {
      "standard": "Income Tax Act 1947",
      "paragraph": "Section 13(8)",
      "authority": "IRAS",
      "officialSourceUrl": "https://sso.agc.gov.sg/Act/ITA1947"
    },
    {
      "standard": "Income Tax Act 1947",
      "paragraph": "Section 10(1)",
      "authority": "IRAS",
      "officialSourceUrl": "https://sso.agc.gov.sg/Act/ITA1947"
    }
  ]
}

